        "tab_xNmDKn": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "OUR MEANING",
            "content": "<p>We started with a question: <strong>what does it really mean to make a promise?</strong> And why hadn’t the jewellery industry evolved to reflect the depth and diversity of the promises we make today?</p><p>Traditionally, promise rings were tied to romantic milestones. And while we’ll <em>always </em>celebrate those love stories – they’re at the heart of so much of what we do – we also knew there was more. Because in real life, promises aren’t one-size-fits-all.</p><p>They can be quiet and steady. Fierce and full of hope. A vow to begin again. A bond between best friends. A reminder to keep going.</p><p><em><strong>We didn’t see jewellery that spoke to those promises. So we created it.</strong></em></p><p>At The Promise Co., we’re here to redefine what a promise ring can be. To move beyond tradition and make space for the full spectrum of what it means to care, to commit, <strong>and to believe in something – or someone.</strong></p><p>This is jewellery that honours all kinds of promises. The big ones. The quiet ones. The ones you share and the ones you keep just for yourself.</p><p>We’re not just building a brand. <strong>We’re building a movement – rooted in real stories</strong>, personal meaning, and the idea that something small can hold something enormous.</p><p>A promise ring is your <strong>own wearable story</strong>. A reminder of who you are, and everything you're becoming.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "open_on_mobile": false
          }
        },
        "tab_e8r46E": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "A NOTE FROM OUR FOUNDER",
            "content": "<p><strong>I've always felt that jewellery should mean something.</strong> The pieces we keep close aren’t just beautiful, they become little anchors in our lives. Reminders of who we are, where we’ve been, and what matters most.</p><p><em>The ring from my Nan that’s never left my finger.</em></p><p><em>The one my partner Raj gave me when we made our first promise.</em></p><p><em>The piece my mum had made for my 21st – filled with pride and love.</em></p><p><strong>They’re more than just pieces of jewellery. They hold meaning. And they’ve stayed with me through everything.</strong></p><p>That’s what I wanted to create with The Promise Co. – jewellery that does the same for you.</p><p>What started as a simple idea, rooted in my love for sentimental jewellery, has grown into something far bigger than I ever imagined. Every day, I get to witness your promises – to your partner, your sister, your oldest friend. And to yourself.</p><p>You trust us with the most personal, powerful moments of your life<strong> –</strong> and that never stops feeling like the greatest privilege.</p><p>So thank you, truly, for being part of this.<br/><br/><strong>You are the reason this brand exists</strong>.</p><p>With all my love,<br/><br/>Charlotte x</p>",
            "page": "",
            "open_on_mobile": false
          }
        }
      },
